<body>



<header>
    
    <img class="logo_tow" src="logo(white)width.svg" alt="Logo">
    <h1>Futuer Technology</h1>
    <img  src="clublogo.jpg" alt="club logo" width="300" height="250" class="logo_one">
    
</header>

<br>


<section class="vision">
<h2 >vision:</h2>
<p>Building a stimulating community that helps members develop their technical knowledge and personal, scientific and professional skills.
</p>
</section>



<section class="massage">
<h2>Message:</h2>
<p class="til">Raising the professional, scientific and practical competence of the technical community in the Kingdom by establishing activities and programs that contribute to developing personal, scientific and professional skills towards achieving the Kingdom’s Vision 2030.
</p>
</section>


<section class="goals">
    <h2>Goals:</h2>  
  
        <ol class="til">
            <li>Creating a fruitful technical environment in which technical expertise intersects between students and experts.</li>
            <li>Improving leadership skills and assuming responsibility among students, placing them in administrative positions and motivating them to participate and cooperate.</li>
            <li>Activating dialogue sessions to express opinions and deal with the cultural/social and technical streets.</li>
            <li>Instilling the concept of initiative, encouraging team spirit, and activating the skill of cooperation and interaction together.</li>
            <li>Promoting moral values ​and stimulating humanitarian initiatives among members.</li>
        </ol>
    
</section>





<div class="contact">
    <h3>For club contact and inquiries:</h3>
    <p><strong>Mobile number:</strong> <a href="tel:+966500003238">+966500003238</a></p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:futuertech@gmail.com">futuertech@gmail.com</a></p>
</div>



